{"title":"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Pascal #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Cayley #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At 2 p.m., Sanjay measures the temperature to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/f/faff50ed7c4ec1b9eafa339eb386d2d5942799e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />C. He measures the temperature every hour after this until 10 p.m. He plots the temperatures that he measures on the graph shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>At what time after 2 p.m. does he again measure a temperature of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/f/faff50ed7c4ec1b9eafa339eb386d2d5942799e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />C?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48a9374bf92c7d0c7f117283f41698436e6f18bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   \\text{9 p.m.}  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   \\text{5 p.m.}  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   \\text{8 p.m.}  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   \\text{10 p.m.} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   \\text{7 p.m.}  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"578\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the graph, we can see that the only time after 2 p.m. where he measures a temperature of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/f/faff50ed7c4ec1b9eafa339eb386d2d5942799e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />C is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce487eb2c3d2ed507de5a0357aa7a6734dc07f85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } \\text{9 p.m.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <